      children: "Data is the foundation of every AI application. Data collection strategies (APIs, web scraping, user-generated, synthetic), data quality dimensions (accuracy, completeness, consistency, timeliness), preprocessing techniques (cleaning, normalization, deduplication, formatting), data curation and labeling strategies, privacy and consent considerations (PII removal, data retention), and synthetic data generation with foundation models."
